#: lib/mobile_app_backend/alerts/formatted_alert.ex:107
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
# Trip identity in the form of ”[time] [vehicle type] from [headsign]”, ex “[12:13 PM] [train] from [Stoughton]”
